Betsy is the third owner and proprietor of [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Haven/Pennywright's Last Stand|Pennywright's Last Stand]], an inn and bar in [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Haven/index|Haven]]. She's a mid-thirties orange-haired [[Bestiary/Rule of Beasts#Amurun|Amurun]], and can often be seen dishing drinks from behind the bar or using her fists to persuade rowdy clientele to calm down.
